        "pmcid:PMC13142478",
        {
          "@id": "https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.04.25.720833"
        }
      ],
      "sc:description": "SpikeLab is a text-to-analysis framework designed for neural spike data that uses an agentic system to guide large language models (LLMs) for robust, reproducible, and expert-vetted electrophysiology analysis. It allows complex analyses (e.g., dose-response studies, network structure) to be executed via natural language prompts without requiring the user to write code.",
